{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_019NdkGLERuDJ5jzEFBmUMod","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Wrote **Q11: Measure accuracy in generative systems?** (`answers/05-011-measure-accuracy-in-generative-systems.md`).\n\n**Key content:**\n- **Core frame:** \"Accuracy\" in generative systems is a four-layer stack — not a single number\n  1. **Structural checks** (100% sync) — schema validation, Pydantic, regex; catches format failures cheap\n  2. **Semantic accuracy** — RAGAS Faithfulness (≥0.85 SLO) + golden-dataset BERTScore F1 on 200–500 annotated examples; NLI entailment (DeBERTa) as sync gate\n  3. **LLM-as-judge** — GPT-4o scoring 5% traffic on correctness/completeness/tone rubric; calibrated against human ratings\n  4. **Business / downstream** — deflection rate, task completion, CSAT/thumbs-down; the true north star\n- **BLEU/ROUGE pitfall:** penalise valid paraphrases, miss factual errors — never use as primary SLOs\n- **Async vs sync:** Layer 1 sync; Layer 2 faithfulness async (1-hour rolling alert); Layer 3 nightly batch — cost/latency control\n\n13 items remaining in the Next queue (Q12–Q23 + validate)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":341,"cache_read_input_tokens":67039,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":341,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ac476ae-c8c1-496c-aade-ee4c9b9db72b","uuid":"450679ef-0bc3-493f-a314-e259ab10a649"}
